Subject: [PATCH 6.12 1/1] i2c: ast2600: change the remove driver call back function

Upstream-Status: Backport [AspeedTech-BMC/linux aspeed-master-v6.12 d3c1f3c535637161129b4202fe5d3c55946e60fa, SDK v00.07.03]

Change back the remove driver call back function from
remove_new to remove

Signed-off-by: Tommy Huang <tommy_huang@aspeedtech.com>
Change-Id: I3b56757cd5f11b7d5365238dcb8e58f6f83434c5

